tyle="padding-right: 0.8pt; text-align: justify"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" format="ixt:fixed-true" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9746;</span></ix:nonNumeric></td></tr> </table><div>
