</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">If an emerging growth company, indicate by check
mark if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition period for complying with any new or revised financial accounting
standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" format="ixt:fixed-false" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Indicate by check mark whether the registrant
is a shell company (as defined in Rule 12b-2 of the Exchange Act). Yes&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" format="ixt:fixed-true" name="dei:EntityShellCompany">&#9746;</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;&#160;No&#160;&#9744;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As of <span>August
9, 2023</span>, there were <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c4" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" unitRef="shares">458,716</ix:nonFraction> shares of Class A common stock, $0.0001 par value and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" unitRef="shares">6,325,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Class B common stock, $0.0001
par value, issued and outstanding.</p><div>

